      }]
    }
    </script></div></div><div class="div-block-26"><div id="w-node-_8b4b329e-e15b-9849-bf20-4a9f259c36bc-cf4d476f" class="div-block-19 center"><div><p class="paragraph-37">Ertugrul Portakal</p><p class="paragraph-38">Oct 13, 2023</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_8b4b329e-e15b-9849-bf20-4a9f259c36b7-cf4d476f" class="div-block-25"><h1 class="heading-78">What is GPT-4V(ision)?</h1><p class="paragraph-39">Unlock the power of visual analysis with GPT-4V by OpenAI! Decode any image, get insights and revolutionize your understanding.</p></div><img loading="lazy" id="w-node-_8b4b329e-e15b-9849-bf20-4a9f259c36c3-cf4d476f" alt="What is GPT-4V(ision)?" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/652971b7c0bfbcafb6ab3958_Product%20GIFs%20(1200%20%C3%97%20630px)%20(11).png" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727px, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/652971b7c0bfbcafb6ab3958_Product%20GIFs%20(1200%20%C3%97%20630px)%20(11)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/652971b7c0bfbcafb6ab3958_Product%20GIFs%20(1200%20%C3%97%20630px)%20(11)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/652971b7c0bfbcafb6ab3958_Product%20GIFs%20(1200%20%C3%97%20630px)%20(11)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/652971b7c0bfbcafb6ab3958_Product%20GIFs%20(1200%20%C3%97%20630px)%20(11).png 1200w" class="image-24"></div></div></div><div class="section blog"><div class="three-column-structure"><div class="div-block-28"><div id="w-node-_8b4b329e-e15b-9849-bf20-4a9f259c36c7-cf4d476f" class="table-of-contents"><h5 class="heading-79">TABLE OF CONTENTS</h5><div data-animation="default" data-collapse="none" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner" class="navbar w-nav"><nav role="navigation" class="links-wrapper w-nav-menu"><a href="#related" class="h1-link w-nav-link">Home</a><a href="#related" class="h2-link w-nav-link">About</a></nav></div></div></div><div class="main-content w-richtext"><p>GPT-4V is a multimodal model designed by OpenAI to analyse visual inputs and generate output using them. GPT-4V allows users to enter visual inputs and generate responses to questions about these inputs. In other words, using the GPT-4V model, you can analyse any type of image you want and obtain information about that image.</p><p>In this article, we will examine the features of GPT-4V and what it can do for you.</p><h2>TL;DR</h2><ul role="list"><li>The GPT-4V is a large multimodal model designed to generate output for queries given with visual inputs.</li><li>GPT-4V can analyse using the given image, answer your questions and solve mathematical problems in the image.</li><li>You can obtain more efficient outputs by adding visual pointers to the image you will give as input to GPT-4V.</li><li>GPT-4V can complete video analysis tasks with high accuracy using the provided video frames.</li><li>If you are looking for an alternative AI assistant where you can experience a fully customizable AI interactions with your unique knowledge and style, TextCortex is the way to go.</li></ul><h2>GPT-4V Features</h2><p>The GPT-4V model comes with features designed to assist users in various aspects of both professional and daily life. Let&#x27;s take a closer look at those features together.</p><h3>Safety and Privacy</h3><p>In its report on GPT-4V, Microsoft stated that while developing the model, the developer team used images that were not accessible online or beyond April 2023. In addition, this method has improved GPT-4V&#x27;s ability to analyse inputs better and generate correct and safe output. Thus, the GPT-4V model does not use online data when generating output but uses real human-level analysis and response skills.</p><h3>Multilingualism</h3><p>According to a Microsoft document, the GPT-4V model can analyse input and generate output in 20 languages such as Chinese, French, and Czech. Additionally, the GPT-4V model can generate responses by reading the texts in visual inputs in these 20 languages. Moreover, you can translate or summarize these inputs into different languages. This feature could be useful if you need to read signs in languages you do not know.</p><figure style="max-width:1087pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="GPT-4 Vision" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bca51acd3e1602e056b_J1XnKBzImz01ePShOfqasfkYHcJTamWOXjZgRh7bFbgghGDDK6Z1nUNaQQmXCTlA0aLflxMwHfoCyf4S4lYO5EEvEXsPajsB26wOT98jaDG3oy2daxMCPzEu0Y4YLNbxw5j0pKkBGLut44lVUOG_TQ.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://openai.com/index/gpt-4v-system-card</figcaption></figure><h3>Visual Referring Prompting</h3><p>To use GPT-4V effectively, it is necessary to use the whole new prompting method that Microsoft calls Visual Referring Prompting. This prompting method requires you to enter a query related to the image you use as input.</p><figure style="max-width:529pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="GPT-4 Vision" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bcadd06ae818ee4e8ab_0WCjzuA4WnVN5mBFChP4EtAKS_0YGw2vbqKswvs8IeU9DyFFlLUNQszAAmhxkzLgqo3vuLLehtQsHnv438ZaCsBvKGraKQ8SzrWCck6_e1iUBDa87QW1Dgse1raOocPaI-NyGhJdpVXBpThwAdXAuA.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://openai.com/index/gpt-4v-system-card</figcaption></figure><p>You can also use the GPT-4V model with simple prompts such as “Describe the image…”. But if you want to push its limits, you can also ask it for complex math problems or coding tasks.</p><figure style="max-width:526pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="what is gpt 4 vision" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bca288665254b5ee963_ozzNgux81LFpcVqqBLr4a8CE4hKyycbj6MfXCSrZJx94NF-e_40xx4OAA-yfY-pJOCfucNdadPDNyGq70J5gdes6Jgi9U2qQLhxWizxcZ2RBA6Q-zP49mWDj0XJAKte20GZ1PyfmQnpZFEwtpngUPw.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><h3>Visual Pointers</h3><p>GPT-4V aims to give users the most useful answer by analysing the prompts related to the given visual. According to Microsoft&#x27;s document, GPT-4V generates more effective output with visual pointers drawn to images. If you want to analyse information in a specific area in the image, you can obtain more consistent outputs by entering a prompt using visual pointers.</p><figure style="max-width:670pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="gpt 4v-ision" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bcbe57147fe10b2b9c7_tckLakYFo9c_5sQtzcku2OLBTM4g8lsIx8mfjpCu5_oxlhHeXyELDquizMlSFcGzN8_-KY1cJjPV40rshcNsnWZr5xc8betMBw6ReTvZyL-RhoyChJ2xYx2wZlPnj_852M7Y9BauGNgoPVcHHmb3YA.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><h3>Scene Text and Chart Reasoning</h3><p>GPT-4V is successful in recognizing text, numbers, and data in each image and generating output based on this information. The GPT-4V model analyses the given input by linking it with the visual and responds to the command or question on the prompt. GPT-4V allow you to complete the following tasks with high accuracy:</p><ul role="list"><li>Visual Math</li><li>Chart Understanding and Reasoning</li><li>Table Recognition</li><li>Document Understanding</li></ul><figure style="max-width:538pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="what is gpt 4 vision model" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bca62c71bd24f2968cb_vXu2B68JelPoBH2frG8QnwiDF_4CYiSs7G80ykBKy4pRPXmyLX1dJjuhK8cP59Vfv3KxYZtY_rQMUm0RZsxzIs_mWlz2KCBym_ou2Fv0jHktA_5UMPPT6njMGiOY4Pil-8sFLQB2uKIQ4lJ87_IiPw.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><p>Researchers gave the GPT-4V model pages from the &quot;Paper Gestalt&quot; as input and asked it to analyse all the data. GPT-4V managed to analyse the paper largely correctly, making only a few mistakes.</p><figure style="max-width:583pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="what can gpt 4 vision do?" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bcaa9ad48eea9b50c38_mk0lAJHxiJcTmRAstVfHhLR85L9Mwv1NMzeXd2FZ0-3vCO-0wB1_URGzoWFdWQ87AnnYc3JNMBj0WTxNLZKt2ec1pVBHxO3Na5Hqsia_pKc4RQo6tbtYfQPWPctHFHHKhFzhrEf26XzLG38o1zgTYg.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><h3>Emotion Detection</h3><p>The GPT-4V model can analyse people&#x27;s faces in given portrait or facial inputs and generate judgments about their emotions. If you do not have a poker face, it is possible to say that AI can analyse you by understanding your emotions. The GPT-4V model is especially successful in understanding seven universal facial expressions: happiness, surprise, contempt, sadness, fear, disgust, and anger.</p><figure style="max-width:909pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="gpt4 vision" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bca88ab1e34aaed446a_Dt7e6cTWtvyn4qAPTH2JNunv9gMOax7cX27lTMeXdoePKw-4n11TSC6E3mql9jov5gucb4WdNB3cbCFbD8OAw_Inis-kUo-qodIVpDhUxq5bkYxvByuiaZ_Z3ikgJziEMaJU9JRyKbipt0N9hL_QjQ.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><h2>What can GPT-4V do for you?</h2><p>The GPT-4V model comes with impressive improvements and features that provide various benefits to users. If you are wondering what the GPT-4V model can do for you, let&#x27;s examine it together.</p><h3>Analysing Images</h3><p>The GPT-4V model is a successful AI that analyses the given visuals and generates output according to the user&#x27;s prompt. For this reason, you can use the GPT-4V model to complete your math problems, book translations or analyse visuals for different scenarios. For example, by providing a room image to GPT-4V, you can output detective analysis about that image.</p><figure style="max-width:889pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="gpt 4 vision analysing images " src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bca0c09ad650d99c951_6WmXeuAWsHym0q812mwDEmj1WePlS4IBUOWIIfM_K0xBx_blstAuJbnajOdUOwzUrSvSuEkdaQtZ7Y0wh1_S1kPMr-hwj67lIZcwTQ1ittbSF29cdh3jAcscfXm3_NVkl8jRUoXvCaQLVELr8XuPfw.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><h3>Image Prompt Generation/Edit</h3><p>By providing an image and textual requirement to the GPT-4V model, you can get a prompt that will allow you to edit your image as you wish. If you want to take your prompt engineering skills to the next level and get help with prompt writing, the GPT-4V model is designed for you.</p><figure style="max-width:507pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="gpt4 vision image generation" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bcaeda69362de7cf9f3_EOFMRzyyRtHfgENpUCjAXJXs0s8-In3fSXM-IYSxNyXNDaXAufNspD-lWawMG2tgJ1xQDJ80jJYVzFr1jAkQiRh-A_HjeeGU9r0D7ReBzw-HgAgAP-PdbCfa8DGFXzH_-E5fTXkGp8X7aQ-zmI7tLw.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><h3>Navigation</h3><p>You can get a navigation output by giving a room, street, or highway image to the GPT-4V model. For example, you can give GPT-4V a room image and a prompt to go to any point in the image, so that it can draw a route and output in text format.</p><figure style="max-width:799pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="gpt 4 vision navigation" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bca853b1a320393e3e6_-eKJgC--tVaT_Ev6zkO4YW2HAPiZXb6oDnFPlZ9iObFa9-GjlsuRRFM8LewAPPGAnHTFfczsSIUoD2kHc7WAfSEZKYi8Q-kYvn2QN0xOzq718yjqzDBX3bB8gypFF7butI5dO10wNNYqLAVHE6xhvQ.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><p>If you are developing a robot and participating in technology competitions or festivals, you can make your robot smarter by using GPT-4V.</p><h3>Video Analysis</h3><p>In today&#x27;s world, one of the most effective methods of learning a new subject or obtaining information about a subject is to watch informative videos. However, if you do not want to watch videos for hours to get information, you can analyse the video using the GPT-4V model. GPT-4V can analyse given frames and generate detailed and consistent descriptions.</p><figure style="max-width:786pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="gpt 4 vision" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/65296bca853b1a320393e3eb_nVEWAHmr-byMLn-mDV9VOXAW3LE2ww8-J3nwfstuj9-GOVT6Q2ybpG_rJ9sX8uvEHTNlPcfSHfqt_IWjTp73G3hYFbZpoSYQpYIu5B9Vvp3vn4Qd6kcOTAQcD6NK1uGJ60oBmQ1PhwZP-46m6z10GA.png"></div><figcaption>source: https://cdn.openai.com/papers/GPTV_System_Card.pdf</figcaption></figure><h2>TextCortex AI – Your Interactive AI Assistant</h2><p><a href="https://textcortex.com/">TextCortex</a> is an AI assistant that offers various features such as text generation, voice-to-text rewriting, and web search. It is available as a web application and browser extension. TextCortex browser extension is integrated with 20.000+ websites and apps, so it can continue to support you anywhere and anytime on the internet.</p><p>In addition to its writing features, TextCortex also offers <a href="https://textcortex.com/templates/zeno-chat-gpt-alternative">ZenoChat</a>, the European ChatGPT alternative. Moreover, our team is working to add emerging AI technologies to TextCortex and bring the capabilities of large multimodal models (LMMs) to our users. Click <a href="https://app.textcortex.com/user/signup?registration_source=home">here</a> to create your freemium TextCortex account and experience the latest AI features!</p></div><div id="w-node-_8b4b329e-e15b-9849-bf20-4a9f259c36e9-cf4d476f" class="div-block-27"><div class="widget-card v2 rainbow"><div data-w-id="8b4b329e-e15b-9849-bf20-4a9f259c36eb" class="widget-inside"><div><h3 class="heading-80">Interested in adopting AI across your organization?</h3><p class="paragraph-40">Teams using TextCortex save 3 work days a month per employee and achieve up to 28x ROI.</p></div><a id="demo" data-href="https://tell.textcortex.com/enterprise" href="https://app.textcortex.com/user/signup?utm_source=side-cta&amp;utm_medium=blog" target="_blank" class="button small blog-sidebar w-button">Get started free</a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="related" class="section"><div class="container w-container"><h2>Did you like this article? Explore a few more related posts.</h2><div class="collection-list-wrapper-2 w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="blog-collection mt-30 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 w-dyn-item"><a href="/post/gpt-5-6-review" class="collection-item w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a616ba0087c3fead697a23d_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(24).png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727px, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a616ba0087c3fead697a23d_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(24)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a616ba0087c3fead697a23d_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(24)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a616ba0087c3fead697a23d_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(24)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a616ba0087c3fead697a23d_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(24).png 1200w" class="blog-card__thumb"><div class="blog-card__cont"><div class="blog-card__text"><h3 class="heading-26">GPT-5.6 Review: Features &amp; Capabilities</h3><div class="text-block-10">Meet GPT-5.6, OpenAI&#x27;s latest flagship model, and discover its advanced capabilities, innovative features, and potential to transform your work.‍</div></div><div class="blog-card__author"><div class="horizontal align-center"><div class="text-block-3 left-align">Ertugrul Portakal</div></div><div class="date">July 23, 2026</div></div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 w-dyn-item"><a href="/post/kimi-k3-review" class="collection-item w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a5d76d9c73b36a855c002da_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(23).png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727px, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a5d76d9c73b36a855c002da_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a5d76d9c73b36a855c002da_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a5d76d9c73b36a855c002da_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(23).png 1200w" class="blog-card__thumb"><div class="blog-card__cont"><div class="blog-card__text"><h3 class="heading-26">Kimi K3 Review: Performance &amp; Features</h3><div class="text-block-10">Introducing Kimi K3, the latest model from Moonshot AI, offering high performance in coding, reasoning, writing, vision, and agentic tasks.‍</div></div><div class="blog-card__author"><div class="horizontal align-center"><div class="text-block-3 left-align">Ertugrul Portakal</div></div><div class="date">July 20, 2026</div></div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 w-dyn-item"><a href="/post/claude-sonnet-5-review" class="collection-item w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a4cfead1eb3f98279c3ad71_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(19).png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727px, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a4cfead1eb3f98279c3ad71_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(19)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a4cfead1eb3f98279c3ad71_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(19)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a4cfead1eb3f98279c3ad71_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(19)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e6b270fba81/6a4cfead1eb3f98279c3ad71_Blog%20Thumbnail%20(19).png 1200w" class="blog-card__thumb"><div class="blog-card__cont"><div class="blog-card__text"><h3 class="heading-26">Claude Sonnet 5 Review: Features &amp; What&#x27;s New?</h3><div class="text-block-10">Meet Claude Sonnet 5, Anthropic&#x27;s latest and powerful AI model, and discover its breakthrough features, capabilities, and innovations.</div></div><div class="blog-card__author"><div class="horizontal align-center"><div class="text-block-3 left-align">Ertugrul Portakal</div></div><div class="date">July 7, 2026</div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><section id="faq" class="section-1 faq"><div class="container"><div class="container align-center"><div class="grid partners-block"><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbc66-a3dbbc61" class="column-medium center"><div class="margin-top-24"><h2 class="heading-10">Questions?  <span class="gradient-text">Answers.</span></h2></div></div><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbc6c-a3dbbc61" class="column-medium center"><div class="grid faq-wrap"><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbc6e-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div class="text-block-98">How does TextCortex work?</div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">TextCortex is a robust enterprise-ready business software designed for companies aiming to integrate AI with their own data and knowledge. It provides advanced features for managing the lifecycle of knowledge and content, catering specifically to business needs such as content creation, data analysis and knowledge management.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbc79-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div class="text-block-39">What&#x27;s the difference between TextCortex, Microsoft Copilot &amp; ChatGPT?</div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">TextCortex is a customizable platform that sets itself apart from Microsoft Copilot and ChatGPT by allowing businesses to tailor AI for specific use cases, automate workflows, and receive detailed, personalized responses. It integrates seamlessly with many tools, such as the Microsoft Suite, and features precise information retrieval with collaborative knowledge management on a GDPR-compliant EU infrastructure. Access to leading AI models, including the GPT models, guarantees exceptional capabilities while offering the flexibility to choose among multiple providers. With multilingual support and an intuitive interface, TextCortex is ideal for global teams.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbc84-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div class="text-block-42">Which languages does TextCortex support?</div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">TextCortex supports more than 25 languages including English, Dutch, German, Ukranian, Romanian, Spanish, Portuguese, French, Italian.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbc9a-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div class="text-block-41">Does TextCortex offer Text Generation API?</div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Yes, we have a Text Generation API. You can generate an API key in your account settings and get started right away.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbca5-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div class="text-block-59">I have an account for myself, can I share it with my colleagues?</div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Account sharing is not allowed. If you need multiple seats for your team, you can explore our enterprise plan.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbcb0-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div class="text-block-43">Does TextCortex offer free trial?</div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Yes, TextCortex offers 14-day free trial for users to try out all features extensively with higher number of generations. But keep in mind that you can already try many of our core features with the free plan.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbcbb-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div class="text-block-44">How are TextCortex&#x27;s reviews on G2, Trustpilot, Capterra, and other platforms?</div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Overall, TextCortex AI has over 2500 reviews on reputable review sites such as G2, Trustpilot and Capterra.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbcd1-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>I cancelled my subscription, what happens to my account?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Your premium features will be available until the end of your subscription date, then your account plan will be set to Free.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_19c6412a-d036-a453-d753-5f0f29eeb30c-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>I cancelled my subscription, what happens to my account?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Your premium features will be available until the end of your subscription date, then your account plan will be set to Free.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_6282b5b4-ad84-fb19-5a4e-33144e960adf-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>What is Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">RAG, or Retrieval-Augmented Generation, enhances language model performance by allowing it to retrieve information from external knowledge sources before generating a response. This results in more informed and contextually relevant outputs. TextCortex leverages this technology, further enhanced by our proprietary data processing, to provide enterprises with powerful and accurate solutions built on the latest advancements in AI.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_701db193-c5ea-f747-559e-421a12e5d25d-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>What is Enterprise AI?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Enterprise AI refers to artificial intelligence solutions specifically designed for business environments, helping organizations automate processes, enhance decision-making, and drive innovation at scale. These solutions address complex business challenges while ensuring security, compliance, and integration with existing systems. TextCortex delivers cutting-edge Enterprise AI through our platform, enabling businesses to transform their operations with customizable, intelligent solutions tailored to their unique needs.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_4b4bb2e6-4782-dbd6-9f63-153362254993-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>What is Enterprise Search?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Enterprise Search refers to technology that enables organizations to search and retrieve information across all their internal data sources, including documents, databases, emails, and applications. It helps employees quickly find relevant information scattered throughout the organization, improving productivity and decision-making. TextCortex enhances traditional enterprise search with AI-powered capabilities, allowing businesses to not only find information but also generate insights and answers from their data through intelligent search and retrieval.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_85b95413-db18-f8ff-0900-b293d28a9838-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>What is a Knowledge Management Software?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Knowledge Management Software helps organizations capture, organize, store, and share institutional knowledge and information across teams and departments. It enables businesses to preserve expertise, reduce knowledge silos, and ensure critical information remains accessible to employees when needed. TextCortex elevates knowledge management by combining traditional organizational capabilities with AI-powered intelligence, allowing businesses to not only store and access their knowledge but also generate insights and answers directly from their information repositories.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_5a592937-31f9-67a5-6210-5c44b5e6ee7c-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>Will TextCortex use our data to train AI models?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">Absolutely not. None of your data will ever be used for model training or fine-tuning.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_779e4ec9-9fc6-e114-f343-e514fb647436-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>Is TextCortex GDPR-compliant?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">We host our services exclusively in the European Union on GDPR-compliant servers, including third-party AI models. Any optional services or LLMs hosted outside the EU are subject to the US-EU Privacy Framework or GDPR Standard Contractual Clauses.<br></p></div></div><div id="w-node-_12e94752-9bee-bc5b-15bf-f0340d1c9c8d-a3dbbc61" class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question"><div><strong>Which LLMs does TextCortex use?</strong></div><div class="faq-icon"><div class="icon-16px"><div class="faq-icon-bar hoz"></div><div class="faq-icon-bar ver"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer"><p class="faq-answer-text">TextCortex uses a variety of large language models (LLMs) from different providers, including the latest Claude, GPT, and Gemini models from companies like Anthropic, OpenAI, Mistral, and Google.</p></div></div><h3 id="w-node-_9f29cb15-b9a8-0509-ebf0-0a19a3dbbcdc-a3dbbc61" class="heading-11">General Questions</h3></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-embed w-script"><script type="application/ld+json">  
