</script></div></section><section class="section-1 master-cta"><div class="container cta"><div class="cta-blue"><div class="column-small homepage"><h2 class="white white-text">Deploy agents across your enterprise.</h2><p class="cta-text">Organize, deploy, and govern AI agents across your enterprise. Built for security, designed for scale.</p></div><div class="simple-flex less-spacing"><a data-w-id="ef98596f-b8a6-3994-d4ae-8041f0e97421" href="/demo" class="button ttp w-inline-block"><div>Get a demo -&gt;</div></a></div></div></div></section><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-wrap"><div class="w-layout-grid grid footer"><div id="w-node-d1e61332-b16f-93be-595d-010ff64117c9-f64117b7" class="column-xs dark-blue"><a href="/" class="brand logo-footer w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/63ca6370ee9367a40efea242_textcortex-white-logo.svg" loading="lazy" width="219" alt="" class="logo-image"></a><div class="margin-top-40"><div class="text-block-8">TextCortex — Search your company knowledge smarter with AI agents.<br></div><div class="div-block-78"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/69033c8c321a5c0fab7fe5e9_hugeicons_security-lock.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-53"><div class="text-block-8 security">SOC 2 &amp; ISO 27001 Certified<br></div></div><div class="socials-wrapper"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@textcortex" target="_blank" class="social-link-new w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/63b81996e4a1616d59e986a9_Vector.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-19"></a><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@textcortex" target="_blank" class="social-link-new w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/63b8192735544c9fbec699c7_Vector.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-19"></a><a href="https://discord.textcortex.com" target="_blank" class="social-link-new w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/63b81a9833958eec5908ed03_Vector.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-19"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/textcortex/" target="_blank" class="social-link-new w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/6512a745056515f1d1871ab1_X.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-19"></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/textcortex-ai/" target="_blank" class="social-link-new w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/63b8193b66300c4c3160bbf5_Vector.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-19"></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/textcortex/" target="_blank" class="social-link-new w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/63b8094e35544c112ac57523_div.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-19"></a><a href="https://www.pinterest.com/textcortex" target="_blank" class="social-link-new w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622611a2b23d0e1ab20fba78/6512a73162de0dee475cf72c_pinterest.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-19"></a></div></div></div><div id="w-node-d1e61332-b16f-93be-595d-010ff64117d4-f64117b7" class="footer-links-wrap"><div class="footer-title">Company</div><a href="/about" class="footer-link">About</a><a href="https://trust.textcortex.com/home" target="_blank" class="footer-link">Trust &amp; Security</a><a href="/terms-of-service" class="footer-link">Terms of Service</a><a href="/privacy-policy" class="footer-link">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/ai-content-policy" class="footer-link">AI &amp; Content Policy</a><a href="https://help.textcortex.com/hc/en-us/articles/21164501390097-Refund-policy" class="footer-link">Refund Policy</a><a href="/imprint" class="footer-link">Imprint</a><a href="https://status.textcortex.com/" target="_blank" class="footer-link">Status</a><a href="https://help.textcortex.com/hc/en-us/requests/new" target="_blank" class="footer-link">Contact</a></div><div id="w-node-d1e61332-b16f-93be-595d-010ff64117df-f64117b7" class="footer-links-wrap"><div class="footer-title">Resources</div><a href="/blog" class="footer-link">Blog</a><a href="https://help.textcortex.com/hc/en-us" target="_blank" class="footer-link">Help Center</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@textcortex" class="footer-link">Cortex Academy</a><a href="https://textcortex.com/ebook/ai-adoption-playbook" class="footer-link">Enterprise AI Adoption Playbook</a><a href="https://textcortex.com/ai-course-for-enterprises" class="footer-link">Complete AI Training for Enterprises</a><a href="/documentation/faq" class="footer-link">FAQ</a></div><div id="w-node-fdb039f4-c986-dacc-7a6f-525eca5a7e58-f64117b7" class="footer-links-wrap"><div class="footer-title">Solutions</div><a href="https://textcortex.com/business/enterprise" class="footer-link">Enterprise AI</a><a href="https://textcortex.com/business/enterprise-ai-agents" class="footer-link">AI Agent Infrastructure</a><a href="https://textcortex.com/business/workflow-automation" class="footer-link">Workflow Automation</a><a href="https://textcortex.com/business/company-knowledge" class="footer-link">Company Knowledge</a></div></div><div class="grid copyright-footer"><div class="auto-year-script w-embed w-script"><script>
